HP DaaS combines hardware, analytics, support, and lifecycle management in single contracts with no upfront capital. Includes PC configuration, data migration, onsite support, and technology recycling. HP TechPulse analytics monitor device health, performance, and security proactively; service experts solve problems before user impact. Consolidates multi-vendor management, shifts IT from reactive troubleshooting to predictive maintenance, and enables flexible technology refresh aligned with business needs rather than fixed replacement cycles.